### B45 — useEffect dependency array semantics
- **Status:** Done. useEffect now compares deps using JSON.stringify and stores previous deps on `window._deps_N`. Counter-based unique keys. Effect callback only fires on first render or when deps stringified value changes.
- **Files:** `racklr/lower-tsx/hook-lower.rkt`

### B44 — Provider stack for context
- **Status:** Done. `useContext` inside JSX `{...}` expressions now correctly transformed via text-level regex in `uir-jsx-expr` nodes. Pipeline reordered: `lower-hooks` runs after `restore-jsx` so it walks the combined UIR including JSX expression text. Also added recursion for `uir-call`, `uir-block`, `uir-if`, `uir-return`, `uir-set!`, `uir-let` compound types.
- **Files:** `racklr/lower-tsx/hook-lower.rkt`, `racklr-test/tsx-integration-test.rkt`

### B43 — Third-party import resolution (node_modules)
- **Status:** Done. `esbuild-resolve.rkt` now handles bare specifiers: finds `import ... from "pkg"` patterns, resolves from node_modules by reading package.json `main` field, adds resolved files to dependency graph. Known externals (react, react-dom, next) silently stripped. Added `#:project-root` parameter for node_modules path.
- **Files:** `racklr/esbuild-resolve.rkt`

### B42 — TS lexer: identifiers ending in digits split
- **Status:** Done. Root cause: `cc-match` in gend-parser.rkt compared `char-general-category` results (lowercase `'nd`, `'mn`) against uppercase (`'Nd`, `'Mn`). Fixed by lowercasing all category comparisons in the template (nl, mn, mc, nd, pc). `val2` now correctly tokenizes as single `Identifier=val2`.
- **Files:** `racklr/gend-parser.rkt`

### B41 — TS lowerer object destructuring
- **Status:** Done. `const { x, y: renamed, z = default } = expr` now lowers to `(const (object-bind [names...] rhs))`. Handles shorthand, renamed, and default patterns. `emit-declaration` in emit-javascript.rkt handles both `array-bind` and `object-bind` with proper bracket emission.
- **Files:** `racklr/lower-typescript.rkt`, `racklr/emit-javascript.rkt`

### B39 — TypeScript generics / type parameters
- **Status:** Done. `singleExpression` level `# GenericTypes` alternative now handled in lower-single-expression (expr.rkt). When the second kid of a 2-kid call is `singleExpression(typeArguments, expressionSequence?)`, type args are stripped and call args extracted from expressionSequence. Handles `fn<T>(args)`, `obj.method<T>(args)`, `new C<T>(args)`. Type parameters on functions/arrows already work (stripped before lowering).
- **Files:** `racklr/lower-typescript/expr.rkt`

